{"step_index":643,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-16T20:02:04Z","input_tokens":3637,"cache_read_tokens":222325,"output_tokens":4806,"thinking":"Initial examination of the data reveals the structure of the `thesis_alpine_results.csv` file, specifically the column names. It contains key metrics for analyzing performance, including container counts and deployment micro-phases. The presence of both deployment and verification phases suggests potential areas for performance comparison and bottleneck identification within the deployment pipeline.\n\n\nAnalyzing data, focusing on the identified metrics, to build bar charts comparing cold container creation to ZFS CoW cloning times across different concurrent container scenarios. A second chart will visualize micro-phase breakdowns for both deployment and verification processes, enabling a direct comparison of time distribution. Considering speedup annotations to provide clear performance gains of cloning relative to cold creation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\nimport numpy as np\\nimport pandas as pd\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\n# Set academic publication style\\nplt.rcParams.update({\\n    'font.size': 11,\\n    'font.family': 'sans-serif',\\n    'axes.labelsize': 12,\\n    'axes.titlesize': 13,\\n    'xtick.labelsize': 10,\\n    'ytick.labelsize': 10,\\n    'legend.fontsize': 10,\\n    'figure.titlesize': 14,\\n    'grid.alpha': 0.3,\\n    'grid.linestyle': '--',\\n})\\n\\nBASE_DIR = Path('/home/davidel/.gemini/antigravity/brain/335ea41a-df46-4ffa-bb4c-eefc5a5248cd/scratch')\\nOUTPUT_DIR = BASE_DIR / 'thesis_figures'\\nOUTPUT_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n\\ndf_alpine = pd.read_csv(BASE_DIR / 'thesis_alpine_results.csv')\\ndf_ubuntu = pd.read_csv(BASE_DIR / 'thesis_ubuntu_results.csv')\\n\\n# Order scenarios by peak containers, then by live containers\\nscenario_order = [\\n    'Test 1 Baseline (alpine)',\\n    'Tier M=2 N=5',\\n    'Tier M=2 N=7',\\n    'Tier M=2 N=10',\\n    'Tier M=10 N=2',\\n    'Tier M=5 N=5',\\n    'Tier M=5 N=7',\\n    'Tier M=5 N=10',\\n    'Tier M=10 N=5',\\n]\\n\\ndef format_scenario_label(row):\\n    m = row['teams_m']\\n    n = row['containers_per_team_n']\\n    peak = row['peak_verify_containers']\\n    if m == 1 and n == 1:\\n        return 'M=1, N=1\\\\n(2 cts)'\\n    return f'M={m}, N={n}\\\\n({peak} cts)'\\n\\n# Sort dataframes\\ndf_alpine['sort_key'] = df_alpine['peak_verify_containers'] * 1000 + df_alpine['live_containers']\\ndf_alpine = df_alpine.sort_values('sort_key').reset_index(drop=True)\\ndf_alpine['label'] = df_alpine.apply(format_scenario_label, axis=1)\\n\\ndf_ubuntu['sort_key'] = df_ubuntu['peak_verify_containers'] * 1000 + df_ubuntu['live_containers']\\ndf_ubuntu = df_ubuntu.sort_values('sort_key').reset_index(drop=True)\\ndf_ubuntu['label'] = df_ubuntu.apply(format_scenario_label, axis=1)\\n\\n\\n# ==============================================================================\\n# GRAPH 1: Cold Deploy Create vs. ZFS CoW Clone Latency (Alpine vs. Ubuntu)\\n# =============================================================================\n<truncated 8784 bytes>","Description":"\"Python script to generate Graph 1 and Graph 2 in PNG and PDF formats\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/home/davidel/.gemini/antigravity/brain/335ea41a-df46-4ffa-bb4c-eefc5a5248cd/scratch/plot_thesis_graphs.py\"","toolAction":"\"Creating plotting script for thesis graphs\"","toolSummary":"\"Write plot_thesis_graphs.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
