tration is I/O-bound.\n4. **Architectural Challenges & Solutions:** OVN dynamic address pool lock contention analysis and static lease allocation fix.\n5. **Conclusions & Contribution Matrix:** Academic takeaway summary.\n\n---\n\n### **Decisions & Next Steps for Your Thesis**\n1. **LaTeX Conversion:** Would you like this chapter converted directly into ready-to-compile `.tex` files with formatted `table` and `figure` environments?\n2. **Additional Figures:** Would you like to generate the **Amortized Per-Container Latency** or **Hysteresis Elasticity Loop** graphs discussed earlier to include as supplementary figures?"}
